      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T07:43:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we track reserved capacity per template instead of `first_time_enabled`? Disabling and re-enabling with a larger `n_flows` currently skips prefill, allowing allocation in the data path. Checking whether the shared pool is allocated would also miss capacity needed by additional templates.",
      "revId": "aec57e9bf96d9b113c39e79aa8ed6e3a7ee10421",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
