      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T07:43:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If prefill fails, the driver has already enabled the template, so we return an error while leaving it enabled; a retry then returns `ALREADY_DONE`. Could we reserve capacity before enabling, or roll back the driver operation on failure?",
